{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n台慶劇《玫瑰戰爭》未播先轟動，官方發布「慾望花園迷宮」海報暗藏玄機！楊茜堯手執玫瑰企正C位，但列陣的8位主角中，竟有3人手上沒有玫瑰，加上另一款海報的「謎之微笑」，究竟誰是忠誰是奸，引發網民瘋狂競猜！\n</p>\n<h2>慾望花園海報揭秘 唯獨陳豪林夏薇陳展鵬冇玫瑰</h2>\n<p>為配合劇中眾人迷失於慾望的主題，劇集其中一款宣傳海報以「花園迷宮」為設計概念。海報中，「復仇大女主」楊茜堯身穿黑白晚裝，獨自手持一枝玫瑰站在迷宮中心，而陳豪、林夏薇、馬國明、陳展鵬、姚子羚、傅嘉莉、陳自瑤及鄺潔楹則齊齊身穿紅色戰衣列陣。最引人注目的是，在列陣的8人之中，只有陳豪、陳展鵬及林夏薇手上沒有玫瑰，這個細節似乎意有所指，完美呼應宣傳語句：「繁花為障，迷宮為局，真相引人追索，慾望使人受困」，令人不禁猜測這三人是否與命案有直接關係。</p>\n<h2>五大帝后齊露「謎之微笑」 爭獎座暗示人人戴假面具</h2>\n<p>除了充滿謎團的「迷宮」海報，另一款以「最佳演員」為主題的海報同樣暗藏深意。海報中，五大視帝視后楊茜堯、陳豪、林夏薇、馬國明、陳展鵬均身穿華麗晚裝，一同高舉演技獎座，似乎在爭奪 Best Actor 及 Best Actress 的殊榮。最令人玩味的是，五人臉上同時展現出難以捉摸的「謎之微笑」，完美呼應劇中角色都是戴著假面具的雙面人，在五光十色的娛樂圈中，每個人都可能是演技高手，將真實的自己隱藏在面具之下。</p>\n<h2>網民化身偵探瘋狂猜測：「冇玫瑰嗰三個係咪兇手？」</h2>\n<p>兩款充滿細節的海報發布後，立即在網上掀起解謎熱潮，網民紛紛化身偵探，對海報中的線索進行瘋狂猜測。最多人討論的便是玫瑰之謎：「張海報好有心思！冇玫瑰嗰三個係咪就係兇手？陳豪、林夏薇、陳展鵬！」、「楊茜堯黑白色衫，其他人紅色，係咪代表佢係局外人負責查案？」、「個個都謎之微笑，睇到毛骨悚然，肯定個個都有陰謀！」、「呢啲細節位先好睇，未開播已經要用腦，好期待劇情點反轉！」、「TVB今次啲海報設計有水準，懸疑感拉滿！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_7027587786aeabf41e73b2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_7027587786aeabf41e73b2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_19580551276aeabf4521573.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_19580551276aeabf4521573.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_13303062016aeabf483a981.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_13303062016aeabf483a981.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_930771356aeabf4aabc0a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_930771356aeabf4aabc0a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_13212294116aeabf4d66873.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_13212294116aeabf4d66873.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_9630756136aeabf500d6c3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_9630756136aeabf500d6c3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_14167446386aeabf5261206.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_14167446386aeabf5261206.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_1047258286aeabf5495dad.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_1047258286aeabf5495dad.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_20920216856aeabf57d08d3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_20920216856aeabf57d08d3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_19264690336aeabf5a990e6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_19264690336aeabf5a990e6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_9313512496aeabf5cc990e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_9313512496aeabf5cc990e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_13422544146aeabf5f024c5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_13422544146aeabf5f024c5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_21129898546aeabf6256eb6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_21129898546aeabf6256eb6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_786700386aeabf65390b3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_786700386aeabf65390b3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_4029039626aeabf68035bf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_4029039626aeabf68035bf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_15005104306aeabf6a771cd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_15005104306aeabf6a771cd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T10:25:43.713300+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1196,"images":16,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T10:00:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T12:18:47.647793+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T10:18:51.576625+00:00","content_hash":"b39925f30352d6bb2415aed511e100cff0cebdc9ffcf6c0b3270b62558cfcccc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}